{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10283240","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10283240","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1028324001:1":{"text":"この処方は……\nあなたたち……誰かがこれを飲んで眠ってしまったんでしょう？","source_cn":"这个药方是……\\n你们几个……是不是有人喝了它之后沉睡...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0118E0650FD6E745","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028324002:1":{"text":"はい。こ、この薬をご存じなのですか？","source_cn":"是的。您……您知道这种灵药？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1ECA3B57BC09A4C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028324003:1":{"text":"やれやれ、この前薬草の生息地を聞かれたときも、むやみに口にしちゃだめだって言ったのにねぇ。","source_cn":"唉，之前你们问过一些草药的生长位置，那会儿我就说了不要乱喝。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24AB62BA468AF5E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1028324004:0":{"text":"これらの薬草を組み合わせた物には、人の意識を奪い、眠りにつかせる効果があるの。目覚めさせるには、特殊な気付け薬が必要よ。","source_cn":"这些草药组合起来能让人失去意识，彻底沉眠，只有一种特殊...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B20B7ADEC31D458","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028324005:1":{"text":"その気付け薬を作ることは……？","source_cn":"您能制作这种嗅盐吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA391799746870CFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028324006:1":{"text":"もちろんできるわ。でも、気付け薬の主な材料に「黄金のハチミツ」というのがあって……","source_cn":"当然可以。不过，制作嗅盐的其中一种主材料叫“黄金蜂蜜”……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC4F27CD76C578FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1028324007:1":{"text":"かなり珍しい物で、リーフベアーが後生大事に守ってるの。老いぼれの私には彼らから手に入れるのは無理だわ。","source_cn":"那东西很少见，叶角熊把它当宝贝。我这老胳膊老腿的，怕是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2947FEA79BDD6FB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1028324008:1":{"text":"材料調達はボクたちにお任せを！それで気付け薬を作ってください！","source_cn":"跑腿的事情交给我们，一会儿制作嗅盐就麻烦您了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DFE6ED02F75E783","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:喝茶的老者":{"text":"お茶を飲んでいる老人","source":"喝茶的老者","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:梅丽莎":{"text":"メリッサ","source":"梅丽莎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"クイン","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":3}}